	(text "Coil 1/16. Pole A: COM4, NC6, NO8. Pole B: COM13, NC11, NO9.\nDe-energized: target VCC = +5V, socket OE/VPP = MCU OE#.\nEnergized: target VCC = +6.25V, socket OE/VPP = VPP_SW.\n470R base resistor supplies ~9mA: the standard G5V-2 coil draws 100mA.\nThe suggested 10k base drive would not guarantee saturation."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 179 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "0a9fd203-73bb-5646-acf7-c916253f4170")
	)
	(text "K1 DPDT / break-before-make / default READ position"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "12967e36-78e1-5077-821f-0243ad87fe72")
	)
	(text "Default-read relay / target connector / monitoring"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "306eafe7-854e-5195-8ecc-c14387e41d32")
	)
	(text "J_TARGET: odd pins on left; even pins on right.\n1-20 A0-A19; 21-28 D0-D7 (protected target side);\n29 CE/PGM#, 30 OE#, 31 PGM#, 32 VPP_SW;\n33 TARGET_VCC, 34 +5V, 35 +6.25V, 36 GND;\n37 PROG_MODE, 38 GND, 39 RESET, 40 GND.\nNEVER wire VPP_SW to address/data/control GPIO.\nAdapters requiring VPP=VCC in READ need physical switching.\nKeep onboard U6 empty when an adapter is installed."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 233 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "791462dc-1671-5633-814b-ee0031a4b29d")
	)
	(text "ADC7: half of target VCC.\n5.00V -> 2.50V; 6.25V -> 3.125V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 248 128 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
